@endpoint = https://127.0.0.1:PORT
@challenge = REPLACE_FROM_DESKTOP_PAIRING
@pollSecret = REPLACE_FROM_PAIRING_RESPONSE
@requestId = REPLACE_FROM_PAIRING_RESPONSE
@token = REPLACE_FROM_APPROVED_STATUS

### A trusted client must verify the desktop certificate pin before sending any secret.
POST {{endpoint}}/v1/pairing
Content-Type: application/json

{"challenge":"{{challenge}}","deviceName":"Example phone"}

### Desktop approval is in-process only. Token is returned once.
POST {{endpoint}}/v1/pairing/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{requestId}}","pollSecret":"{{pollSecret}}"}

### Synchronize only selected categories; no data does not mean zero.
POST {{endpoint}}/v1/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"records":[],"categories":[{"metric":"HeartRate","availability":"NoData"}]}

### Disconnect and erase in-memory session state.
DELETE {{endpoint}}/v1/session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unauthorized ingestion returns a safe problem before binding the body.
POST {{endpoint}}/v1/records
Content-Type: application/json

{}
